  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until they are pink and fully cooked.",
    "Add the rice wine and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the shrimp and sauce over cooked rice or couscous."
